      value: Truth be told, I couldn't tell what drew me to this image. I mean, for
        goodness' sake, it doesn't even show that much. However, despite its dullness,
        it has a sharp edge, quite literally. The sharpness, the angle and the corner
        shift all work together to guide the eye from one side to the other.
