      value: A hole in the wall, or should I say, the seabed? What lies beneath us,
        waiting to emerge once again? Is this arch the way down to Atlantis, or is
        it simply another one of Mother Nature's beautiful creations? The blue water,
        combined with the green mountainside, creates a path down to the seabed.
