      propertyPath: artworkDescription
      value: Bobbing up and down, the people ride the Demons Ride all night long,
        hopefully laughing and enjoying a break from all their worries. The structure
        stretches perfectly diagonally across the sky, while little specks of heads
        can be seen moving up. Maybe it's their first ride of the night, or perhaps
        their 100th.
